Leading attribute brace before an inline span stays literal

```
{k=v}{+i+}
.
<p>{k=v}<ins>i</ins></p>
```

```
x{.k title="`"} y

x{title="[a"}](u)

x{*a { b*} c
.
<p>x{.k title=“<code>"} y</code></p>
<p>x{title=“<a href="u">a”}</a></p>
<p>x<strong>a { b</strong> c</p>
```

```
x*{title="`"} y

*x*{title="`"} y
.
<p>x*{title=“<code>"} y</code></p>
<p><strong title="`">x</strong> y</p>
```
